# GCMC for H2O/CO2 molecular fluid, rigid/nvt/small dynamics
# both molecules are in the same molecule template, the molindex
# keyword selects which molecule each fix gcmc command inserts,
# so that both can share the same fix rigid/nvt/small command
# Rigid SPC/E water model
# [H.J.C. Berendsen, J.R. Grigera, and T.P. Straatsma,
# The missing term in effective pair potentials,
# J. Phys. Chem., 91, 6269-6271 (1987)].
# Rigid CO2 TraPPE model
# [J.J. Potoff and J.I. Siepmann, Vapor-liquid equilibria of
# mixtures containing alkanes, carbon dioxide and
# nitrogen AIChE J., 47,1676-1682 (2001)].

# variables available on command line

variable        muh2o index -8.0
variable        muco2 index -8.30
variable        disp index 0.5
variable        temp index 338.0
variable        lbox index 15.0

# global model settings

units           real
atom_style      full
boundary        p p p
pair_style      lj/cut/coul/long  14
pair_modify     mix arithmetic tail yes
kspace_style    ewald 0.0001
bond_style      harmonic
angle_style     harmonic

# box, start molecules on random places

region          box block 0 ${lbox} 0 ${lbox} 0 ${lbox} units box
region          box block 0 15.0 0 ${lbox} 0 ${lbox} units box
region          box block 0 15.0 0 15.0 0 ${lbox} units box
region          box block 0 15.0 0 15.0 0 15.0 units box
create_box      4 box                                       bond/types 2                                angle/types 2                               extra/bond/per/atom 2                       extra/angle/per/atom 1                      extra/special/per/atom 2
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (15 15 15)
  1 by 2 by 2 MPI processor grid

# molecule template with both molecules for fix rigid/nvt/small and fix gcmc
molecule        mols H2O.txt CO2.txt toff 2 boff 1 aoff 1
